# Plan files

When creating or editing `.cursor/plans/`:

- **Todos:** pending items only. When work ships, remove completed todos on the next plan edit — do not accumulate a done list.
- **Body:** spec for remaining work and decisions. No "done on main", phase-0 retrospectives, or success-criteria checkboxes for shipped items.
- **State as facts, not changelog:** reference current paths and behaviour the implementer needs; do not narrate what changed or when.
- **Same session:** after completing plan work, update the plan before finishing the task.
